DTSTAMP:20261010T174029Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-54171323569878-54171323569879@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Abstract\n\nBatteries are increasingly central to transportati
 on and the electric grid\, yet many of the processes that determine their 
 lifetime\, safety\, and performance remain hidden from conventional measur
 ements. In this talk\, I will discuss two complementary approaches for gai
 ning access to this hidden information. First\, cryogenic electron microsc
 opy enables direct visualization of battery interfaces and degradation pro
 cesses at the nanoscale. Second\, machine-learning-based virtual sensing c
 an\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-10-10 10:40 PDT
LOCATION:Green Earth Sciences Building
END:VEVENT
